    given-names: Hio Wai
repository-code: https://github.com/Mangolycheematcha/qualify-environmental-evidence
abstract: >-
  A reproducible proof of concept for qualifying, not validating, public
  registry and Earth-observation evidence before use in regulated financial
  workflows. It separates bounded scientific observations from authority,
  compliance, assurance, carbon-credit, and investment conclusions.
